              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhoya are kumukhono kwewe khu murwe kwe siianwa sirusiao bubwoni, mala alirire abuundu niio bakhonyelaanga biianwa bie khukhwosia. ",
          "type": "text",
